/*
  Component:  Compression spring mean dia 10 / wire 1 x 20
  Standard:   
  Family:     compression spring (simplified)
  Size:       
  Length:     20 mm
  Data source: Parametric helical sweep; no spring rate, end-coil, or grinding model.
  Notes:      Open helical spring with circular wire and flat swept end caps. The wire section is swept in the radial-axial plane and is a 12-gon; the helix tangent used by the sweep has no axial component, so the section normal to the true helix is slightly elliptical. Closed/ground ends and preload are not modeled.
  Features modeled:      helix-body
  Features approximated: helical-wire (SweptSpline, deviation 0.04277569313094809 mm, control segments_per_turn=24); wire-section (PolylineArc, deviation 0.017037086855465844 mm, control wire_segments=12)
  Features omitted:      closed-end-coils (not modelled by this builder); ground-ends (not modelled by this builder); spring-rate (geometry only; no spring rate or preload model)
  Feature tolerance:     0.01 mm
*/
